cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this Lean formalization, cite this software release and the
  original mathematical source for each theorem used.
title: "ProbabilityApproximation: Berry–Esseen Bounds for Independent Sums"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yan
    given-names: Asher
version: 0.9.6
date-released: 2026-07-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/Polarnova/ProbabilityApproximation"
url: "https://github.com/Polarnova/ProbabilityApproximation/releases/tag/v0.9.6"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of nonuniform Berry–Esseen bounds via
  Stein's method and Bentkus's dimension-dependent multivariate Gaussian
  approximation over measurable convex sets.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalized mathematics
  - probability theory
  - Berry–Esseen theorem
  - central limit theorem
  - Stein's method
  - multivariate normal approximation
  - convex geometry
